    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "### AgeAge is a numeric column. The minimum age in the dataset is 18 and the maximum age is 64. Thus, we can visualize the distribution of age using a histogram with 47 bins (one for each year) and a box plot. We'll use plotly to make the chart interactive, but you can create similar charts using Seaborn."
