      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "indirect-morocco"
      },
      "source": [
        "All of the above columns will be added to `train_inputs`, `val_inputs` and `test_inputs`.To perform the encoding, we use the `transform` method of `encoder`."
