      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "We begin by importing the data. For this example, we'll use three columns: \"yaw\", \"pitch\" and \"roll\"."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
